sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant V as Victim
  participant P as Phishing Site (AitM)
  participant RP as Legitimate RP
  participant OTP as SMS/Email OTP

  V->>P: Enter username & password
  P->>RP: Relay credentials
  RP-->>OTP: Send one-time code
  P-->>V: Prompt for OTP (fake)
  V->>P: Enter OTP
  P->>RP: Use OTP to finish login
  RP-->>P: Session/Cookies
  P-->>V: Fake success or redirect
